{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Pagora 是一款把筆記、任務、頁面與專案集中管理的現代工作空間，適合學生、上班族及需要規劃個人專案的人士。它支援文字、待辦清單、表格、看板、附件與提醒等內容，現時由原價 US $0.99 降至<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，讓用戶以更低成本建立清晰有序的工作流程。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-103.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>靈活區塊整合筆記任務</h2>\n<p>Pagora 以靈活區塊建立頁面與子頁面，可加入標題、清單、表格、進度、程式碼、看板、畫廊及錄音，並管理任務狀態、優先次序與到期日。用戶亦可使用標籤整理內容、設定提醒、查看日曆與最近頁面，資料保存在裝置上，並可透過私人 CloudKit 與個人 iCloud 帳戶同步。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-338-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-339-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-340-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-341-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-342-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-343-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Pagora</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/pagora/id6781091419?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T04:42:23.499166+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":318,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T04:27:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T11:19:04.166405+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T04:38:36.478169+00:00","content_hash":"69bf60c080dff450beefd9598253aa4e1a598f5b5719fa3c2e5b6f01df971e5d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}